From 9f47b13aea7439657ebdd00df03e6248db1b04b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: liamtw22 <31185529+liamtw22@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] device/archived: remove amazon-biscuit (replaced by
 device/testing)

The biscuit port lives in its own overlay (pmaports-biscuit), which adds
device/testing/device-amazon-biscuit and device/testing/linux-amazon-biscuit.
pmbootstrap refuses two aports with the same package name, so the archived
Fire OS 3.18 vendor-kernel port has to go when the overlay is copied in.
